WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:32.190 --> 01:34.800
Golden Week is coming up soon.

01:34.800 --> 01:37.110
And we get another long vacation, huh?

01:37.110 --> 01:39.040
You don't want one?

01:39.040 --> 01:42.240
It's more that I just don't know 
how to spend my time.

01:42.240 --> 01:44.580
Weren't you going to teach Chitose to cook?

01:44.970 --> 01:47.460
That's about all I had planned.

01:47.850 --> 01:52.620
Yeah, I guess it's nice to get a break, 
but tough when you have no plans.

01:52.620 --> 01:54.970
Will you be free, Amane-kun?

01:54.970 --> 01:55.970
Yeah, I'm free.

01:58.230 --> 01:59.450
What's on your mind?

02:03.680 --> 02:04.890
<b>Do-Anything-You-Want</b>

02:03.680 --> 02:04.890
<b>Ticket</b>

02:04.890 --> 02:07.180
May I use this?

02:09.060 --> 02:11.150
You may ask for whatever you please.

02:11.660 --> 02:15.900
I would like you to give me 
one day during Golden Week.

02:15.900 --> 02:20.910
Going Out with the Angel

02:21.720 --> 02:27.330
During Golden Week, I want to go 
shopping with you and hang out and stuff.

02:29.970 --> 02:31.290
Isn't that allowed?

02:31.740 --> 02:37.010
Yeah, but you don't need to use that. 
I'm happy to go shopping with you anytime.

02:37.390 --> 02:41.390
I'll use it. And you'll have to do 
whatever I ask that day.

02:43.640 --> 02:49.350
If you put it that way, fine with me. 
But what do you want me to do?

02:48.270 --> 02:49.480
<b>Do-Anything-You-Want</b>

02:48.270 --> 02:49.480
<b>Ticket</b>

02:51.090 --> 02:52.980
C-Carry my bags.

02:53.860 --> 02:55.920
Sure, sure, as you wish.

02:56.650 --> 02:58.330
And where do you want to go?

03:00.260 --> 03:02.780
I haven't decided that yet.

03:03.160 --> 03:04.890
You haven't even decided?

03:05.480 --> 03:09.710
Well, I don't know what kind of place 
you'd like to go to.

03:09.710 --> 03:10.750
Huh? Me?

03:11.210 --> 03:16.470
If we're going out together, I want to go 
somewhere we can both have fun.

03:21.250 --> 03:22.380
Is that all right?

03:31.730 --> 03:33.440
Then there is one place.

03:34.080 --> 03:35.020
Where is it?

03:35.480 --> 03:36.400
You'd better not laugh.

03:36.800 --> 03:37.980
I will not laugh.

03:38.510 --> 03:39.610
A cat café.

03:39.610 --> 03:40.440
Huh?

03:40.440 --> 03:43.940
I thought... it won't be 
embarrassing if we go together.

03:45.090 --> 03:45.990
No good?

03:46.870 --> 03:49.950
No, it's fine. All right, then.

03:50.510 --> 03:52.160
Let's go there together.

03:52.160 --> 03:52.950
Yeah.

03:54.390 --> 03:55.630
What about after that?

03:56.270 --> 03:59.560
After that, we can go shopping.

03:59.560 --> 04:02.830
Oh, I also want to go to an arcade.

04:02.830 --> 04:05.470
I've never been to one of those before.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.350
Let's do all of that.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.760
It sounds like fun.

04:12.470 --> 04:15.100
I can't wait for break to start.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.060
Me, neither.

04:18.860 --> 04:20.640
Yay!

04:20.640 --> 04:24.120
The first lesson of Mahirun's cooking school!

04:24.120 --> 04:28.700
Of course, we've invited Mahiru Shiina 
to lead us as instructor.

04:28.700 --> 04:31.450
<i>You</i> were the one invited here, you know.

04:31.770 --> 04:33.250
And to serve as our poison tes—

04:33.250 --> 04:34.320
I mean, as our guest,

04:34.320 --> 04:38.140
we've invited extremely 
picky eater Amane Fujimiya.

04:38.140 --> 04:41.460
Would you cool it? And this is <i>my</i> home.

04:41.790 --> 04:44.030
Aw, you're no fun.

04:44.030 --> 04:45.840
Sorry to bother you so early.

04:46.290 --> 04:49.910
It's fine, it's fine. 
And you're making me breakfast.

04:49.910 --> 04:51.600
But that aside...

04:51.930 --> 04:52.730
Hmm?

04:53.150 --> 04:55.980
Make sure Chitose doesn't spike 
the recipe with anything weird.

04:55.980 --> 04:58.080
You aren't very trusting.

04:58.080 --> 05:00.970
Oh, yeah? What about the crime 
you committed on Valentine's Day?!

05:01.990 --> 05:04.600
Oh, come on. That was totally just a prank!

05:04.600 --> 05:06.910
If I cook normally, it'll be safe. Maybe.

05:08.070 --> 05:11.070
That "maybe" is exactly what bothers me.

05:11.070 --> 05:13.700
Please, just make me something edible.

05:13.700 --> 05:16.170
No problem! I got this!

05:17.370 --> 05:19.450
Shall we get started, then?

05:19.450 --> 05:22.210
Yeah! Where should we start?

05:22.810 --> 05:24.680
Why don't we peel the shrimp?

05:24.680 --> 05:25.670
Okay!

05:26.350 --> 05:31.690
The easiest way to peel a shrimp is to 
hold it in both hands with the back up,

05:31.690 --> 05:35.810
then put your index fingers between
 the third and fourth segments

05:35.810 --> 05:38.160
and pull to the sides.

05:38.160 --> 05:41.270
Oh, wow! It comes off so easy!

05:45.520 --> 05:49.070
U-Um, that tickles a little.

05:52.150 --> 05:53.340
Mahiru?

05:53.340 --> 05:54.380
Yes.

05:54.380 --> 05:55.420
Good morning.

05:55.420 --> 05:57.440
And good morning to you.

05:57.440 --> 06:00.430
It's a little late in the day 
for that, though.

06:00.430 --> 06:01.420
Huh?

06:01.420 --> 06:02.540
Ah!

06:02.800 --> 06:05.790
When I sat down, you started leaning on me.

06:05.790 --> 06:08.910
Oh... sorry! That must have bothered you.

06:08.910 --> 06:11.100
Huh? N-No, not at all!

06:11.530 --> 06:15.560
Mahirun's more like, "Amane-kun cozies up 
to me when he's half-asleep?"

06:15.560 --> 06:17.100
I bet that's what she thought.

06:17.100 --> 06:18.390
Chitose-san!

06:18.750 --> 06:23.650
But I wonder, when did you start calling
 each other by your first names, you two?

06:24.080 --> 06:25.630
Chitose!

06:25.630 --> 06:27.260
Don't look at me like that!

06:27.260 --> 06:29.340
You're the one who just slipped up.

06:31.490 --> 06:34.010
You better not have pulled 
any pranks while I was sleeping.

06:34.010 --> 06:35.830
I didn't prank you at all.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.830
What troubles you, my lad?

06:40.320 --> 06:42.750
Maybe not a prank, 
but I bet you did something.

06:42.750 --> 06:46.240
Not <i>me</i>! I didn't do a single thing.

06:46.240 --> 06:48.040
Is that the truth?

06:48.040 --> 06:50.580
Mahiru, did she really do nothing?

06:51.840 --> 06:55.030
Chitose-san didn't do anything.

06:58.050 --> 06:59.230
Oh, this looks good!

06:59.990 --> 07:01.730
Mahiru, how's it taste?

07:01.730 --> 07:05.470
It's fine. There's nothing weird in it.

07:05.470 --> 07:06.650
I tasted it myself.

07:07.230 --> 07:08.030
Very well.

07:08.030 --> 07:10.800
When are you gonna stop suspecting me?

07:10.800 --> 07:12.700
I cooked fair and square today.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.870
Then thank you for the food.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.460
Yum!

07:28.280 --> 07:30.800
I bet this will make Ikkun happy!

07:30.800 --> 07:33.590
Mahirun, thanks for the cooking lesson!

07:34.000 --> 07:36.510
You're welcome. I enjoyed doing it.

07:36.910 --> 07:39.020
Thanks for having me over.

07:43.940 --> 07:45.520
I... should apologize.

07:46.060 --> 07:46.810
Huh?

07:47.320 --> 07:48.830
For the prank.

07:48.830 --> 07:49.740
The prank?

07:50.250 --> 07:54.320
Chitose-san didn't do anything, but I...

07:54.720 --> 07:56.280
You, Mahiru?!

07:56.890 --> 07:59.410
I... squished your cheeks.

08:00.200 --> 08:03.310
Does that even count as a prank?

08:03.310 --> 08:09.670
A-And then I watched you sleep 
and ruffled your hair a bit.

08:10.030 --> 08:12.300
You sure like doing that, Mahiru.

08:12.300 --> 08:17.130
Y-Yes. You look so cute 
when sleeping, I couldn't help...

08:17.130 --> 08:17.890
Couldn't help...?

08:17.890 --> 08:20.930
...but to squish your cheeks a whole lot!

08:21.310 --> 08:24.560
Is poking a guy's cheeks 
really that much fun?

08:25.300 --> 08:26.610
Why, yes, it is.

08:26.610 --> 08:29.300
Well, I guess that makes sense.

08:29.870 --> 08:32.690
It feels nice to squeeze your cheeks, too.

08:42.700 --> 08:45.030
<i>She's, like, totally relaxed.</i>

08:51.040 --> 08:53.290
We're going out tomorrow.

08:53.290 --> 08:53.920
Yeah.

08:55.880 --> 08:57.340
Amane-kun?

08:58.130 --> 09:03.980
Which do you prefer, 
prim and proper or a more mature look?

09:03.980 --> 09:05.100
What?

09:06.040 --> 09:09.000
Oh. Hmm...

09:10.280 --> 09:12.480
I think it depends on the person.

09:13.260 --> 09:15.400
But I'm asking what <i>you</i> like, Amane-kun.

09:15.770 --> 09:18.100
I'm not sure what to say.

09:22.610 --> 09:26.120
Prim and proper would fit your 
character and look cute on you,

09:26.120 --> 09:29.850
but a mature style would 
highlight how pretty you are.

09:30.300 --> 09:33.900
Y-You really have no trouble 
saying things like that.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.380
Boy...

09:35.840 --> 09:38.700
Well, you're the one who asked, Mahiru.

09:41.210 --> 09:42.890
Okay, prim and proper.

09:43.700 --> 09:44.980
Then that's what I'll go with.

09:45.990 --> 09:50.270
I'll break through that composure 
and leave you weak in the knees.

09:50.270 --> 09:53.110
That doesn't sound 
very prim and proper to me.

09:53.550 --> 09:56.490
In that case, I'll just try to 
leave you speechless.

09:56.830 --> 09:59.030
Try not to bother me too much, okay?

09:59.920 --> 10:01.950
I'll bother you as much as possible.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.960
Good morning, Amane-kun.

10:17.720 --> 10:19.590
You put your hair up today?

10:20.020 --> 10:23.340
I didn't want it to get in the way 
if we're playing with cats.

10:23.980 --> 10:24.970
Does it look okay?

10:24.970 --> 10:26.480
Yeah, looks great on you.

10:26.830 --> 10:28.960
Well, I hope so, but...

10:28.960 --> 10:32.440
U-Um, if you're going to laugh, 
go ahead and do it.

10:33.510 --> 10:34.610
Why would you say that?

10:35.010 --> 10:36.740
I bet you think I overdid it.

10:37.340 --> 10:41.200
No, I don't. I do think 
you look cuter than usual, though.

10:42.650 --> 10:47.950
You must have had a fine upbringing 
if you can say something like that so lightly.

10:48.460 --> 10:49.920
Yeah, I guess so.

10:50.530 --> 10:53.620
Of course, I'm not just trying to 
flatter you, so don't worry.

10:53.620 --> 10:55.050
I'll take your word for it.

10:55.660 --> 10:57.420
Shall we get going, then?

10:58.570 --> 10:59.980
May I take your hand?

11:04.730 --> 11:06.480
They're so cute!

11:06.480 --> 11:08.360
Look at this one over here!

11:07.770 --> 11:10.380
<b>Leo-kun</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.640
<b>Powder-chan</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.640
<b>Amber-kun</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.640
<b>Bell-chan</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.640
<b>Silk-chan</b>

11:11.310 --> 11:13.520
The cats! Look at them!

11:13.820 --> 11:15.660
They're all so cute!

11:15.660 --> 11:17.900
You're right. They're really cute.

11:19.580 --> 11:23.160
This one is named Silk.

11:21.950 --> 11:23.160
<b>Silk-chan</b>

11:23.160 --> 11:25.150
Silk-chan?

11:27.540 --> 11:29.870
<b>Ten-kun</b>

11:27.540 --> 11:29.870
<b>Leo-kun</b>

11:30.350 --> 11:34.790
That doesn't mean she doesn't like you. 
She was just done saying "hello."

11:34.790 --> 11:37.010
Do you really think so?

11:37.010 --> 11:39.640
Yeah. Give them some time to get used to you.

11:40.350 --> 11:41.940
Want to grab a seat for now?

11:41.940 --> 11:42.890
Sure.

11:44.500 --> 11:46.260
Oh my gosh, it's so cute!

11:47.510 --> 11:48.490
What's wrong?

11:48.970 --> 11:50.680
It's too cute to drink.

11:52.810 --> 11:54.440
Please don't laugh at me!

11:54.440 --> 11:57.790
It's just such a cute thing 
to be worried about.

11:57.790 --> 12:01.650
B-But they made such a cute kitty.

12:01.650 --> 12:04.380
It would be a waste to ruin it.

12:04.380 --> 12:06.760
It would be a waste to not drink it.

12:16.650 --> 12:18.750
Wh-Why are you laughing at me?

12:18.750 --> 12:23.010
Well, you got a white mustache.

12:23.010 --> 12:25.300
Hey! You took a picture, didn't you?!

12:25.660 --> 12:28.560
Oh, sorry. Do you want me to erase it?

12:28.560 --> 12:31.140
Y-You want to save me looking this silly?

12:31.710 --> 12:33.560
It was too cute to pass up.

12:35.300 --> 12:37.470
Okay, but only just the one.

12:40.220 --> 12:42.980
Look at this! It climbed up on my lap!

12:42.980 --> 12:46.910
That's great. Look, it wants to be pet.

12:46.910 --> 12:47.900
Sure!

12:50.280 --> 12:51.680
By the way...

12:52.710 --> 12:55.620
When did you and Silk-chan get so friendly?

12:55.620 --> 12:58.750
I don't know why, 
but she came over to be pet.

12:59.380 --> 13:02.670
Does that mean you like Silk-chan, then?

13:02.670 --> 13:06.340
Yeah, maybe because she's like you. 
She's so cuddly.

13:06.750 --> 13:07.720
Like me?

13:07.720 --> 13:14.350
Well, you were a little stuffy at first. 
Kind of uptight and unfriendly.

13:14.900 --> 13:17.480
Once you got used to me, 
you were a lot more affectionate.

13:18.320 --> 13:20.220
I'm not a cat, you know.

13:20.220 --> 13:22.940
And I don't cozy up to just anyone.

13:23.460 --> 13:26.480
Well, you are still very cautious, though.

13:26.480 --> 13:28.320
Have you been treating me like a cat?

13:28.320 --> 13:31.080
No way, no way. Right?

13:33.080 --> 13:35.470
You <i>have</i> been treating me like a cat.

13:45.750 --> 13:46.970
Wanna take a look?

13:47.740 --> 13:51.390
See that dress? 
I bet it would look good on you.

13:51.390 --> 13:53.850
Do you like this kind of thing?

13:54.580 --> 13:55.880
Well, I guess.

13:56.530 --> 14:00.810
You look good in anything, Mahiru, 
but I think this would look great on you.

14:01.640 --> 14:03.610
Then I'll go try it on.

14:10.950 --> 14:13.240
Hey, there. All by yourself?

14:13.930 --> 14:14.740
Well...

14:16.160 --> 14:18.420
If you're free, wanna go somewhere?

14:18.420 --> 14:20.380
Actually, I'm waiting for someone.

14:21.690 --> 14:23.440
Sorry to take so long.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.060
O-Oh.

14:25.060 --> 14:26.420
Please excuse us.

14:26.420 --> 14:27.860
Shall we go?

14:27.860 --> 14:28.890
Uh...

14:38.310 --> 14:39.040
Now!

14:39.040 --> 14:39.770
Right!

14:48.040 --> 14:49.750
You did great, Mahiru.

14:50.110 --> 14:53.380
Um, will you accept this from me?

14:53.380 --> 14:54.620
Huh? For me?

14:54.620 --> 14:57.000
You gave me the ones before, and...

14:57.000 --> 15:00.290
you seemed to like Silk-chan so much.

15:02.010 --> 15:05.730
But I know you're a boy. 
Maybe you don't like stuffed animals?

15:05.730 --> 15:07.860
No, that isn't it.

15:07.860 --> 15:11.590
I just don't think I should take it 
when you tried so hard to get it.

15:12.060 --> 15:14.830
But you're the reason I was trying!

15:14.830 --> 15:19.980
Oh! That is, I don't mean to 
sound so pushy...

15:21.110 --> 15:23.380
Okay, I'll take it and put it in my room.

15:23.380 --> 15:27.610
I can't put it right next to my 
pillow like you do, though.

15:29.140 --> 15:32.240
I wish you would forget all about that!

15:33.870 --> 15:35.130
I'll take good care of it.

15:35.130 --> 15:36.490
Shiina-san?

15:38.760 --> 15:40.020
Kadowaki-san?

15:40.020 --> 15:42.940
Um... did I interrupt something?

15:42.940 --> 15:44.500
No, not at all.

15:45.320 --> 15:48.130
I had no idea you had a boyfriend.

15:49.100 --> 15:51.340
He isn't actually my boyfriend or anything.

15:52.300 --> 15:54.590
But it totally looks like...

15:57.100 --> 15:58.440
Fujimiya?

15:59.770 --> 16:04.860
Huh. So you live next door and 
you've known each other since last year?

16:04.860 --> 16:05.560
Yeah.

16:05.940 --> 16:10.240
Well, that's fine, 
but it's just like Itsuki said.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.190
About what?

16:11.480 --> 16:14.550
He said you look really cool 
when you get dressed up.

16:14.550 --> 16:16.410
You really nail this look.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.630
That sounds like sarcasm 
coming from you, Kadowaki.

16:19.630 --> 16:21.870
That's not how I meant it!

16:21.870 --> 16:25.710
So, you knew he could 
look like this, Shiina-san?

16:25.710 --> 16:27.350
Well, I just...

16:28.640 --> 16:29.630
Yes.

16:29.630 --> 16:31.550
I'm starting to get it now.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.680
I bet it's tough for you, too, Shiina-san.

16:36.400 --> 16:38.680
I didn't think you'd be 
so easy to figure out.

16:41.510 --> 16:42.980
Um, Kadowaki-san?

16:42.980 --> 16:43.690
Hmm?

16:44.540 --> 16:47.740
I'd prefer if you didn't tell 
anyone else about this.

16:47.740 --> 16:50.980
Th-That we're close and all. It's kind of...

16:50.980 --> 16:54.570
Sure. You don't have to worry about that.

16:55.310 --> 16:58.280
I don't go around spreading 
people's secrets for fun.

16:59.260 --> 17:02.490
And I don't want to screw things up 
with Fujimiya over something dumb,

17:02.490 --> 17:04.830
especially now that we're friends.

17:12.600 --> 17:13.920
I'm really sorry.

17:14.510 --> 17:16.180
What makes you say that?

17:16.580 --> 17:19.200
Since Kadowaki found out about us.

17:19.790 --> 17:21.940
That was out of your control.

17:21.940 --> 17:24.400
And it turned out all right, anyway.

17:24.400 --> 17:26.940
It seemed like he was understanding.

17:27.620 --> 17:32.400
There was no guarantee 
we wouldn't be spotted anyway.

17:30.940 --> 17:34.440
Platform 2      First Departure 18:31      Express

17:30.940 --> 17:34.440
Platform 2      Next Departure 18:40      Express

17:32.400 --> 17:34.440
I knew it was a possibility.

17:35.090 --> 17:37.640
I'm sure glad it was Kadowaki, though.

17:37.640 --> 17:39.070
He really is a good guy.

17:39.500 --> 17:43.780
You seem to think 
very highly of him, Amane-kun.

17:43.780 --> 17:44.990
Well, yeah.

17:44.990 --> 17:48.500
Since we started talking more, 
he really seems pretty cool.

17:48.500 --> 17:50.770
I can get why he's so popular.

17:50.770 --> 17:52.840
He's as good of a person 
as he is good looking.

17:53.310 --> 17:55.840
I guess that makes you 
birds of a feather, then.

17:56.340 --> 17:58.590
I doubt I'm that kind of bird, though.

17:59.400 --> 18:01.350
There you go, putting yourself down again.

18:01.970 --> 18:03.170
It's a bad habit.

18:03.170 --> 18:06.620
How did you even pick that habit up? Hmph.

18:07.600 --> 18:08.090
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:07.600 --> 18:09.600
Platform 2      First Departure 18:31      Express

18:08.140 --> 18:12.860
<i>The train for Tama Center will be arriving 
on platform two momentarily.</i>

18:08.270 --> 18:09.090
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:09.310 --> 18:09.590
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:10.160 --> 18:12.860
If you don't want to say it, 
you don't have to.

18:13.460 --> 18:17.030
<i>Please wait behind the doors.</i>

18:13.460 --> 18:17.710
But please don't forget 
that I accept you, okay?

18:18.650 --> 18:19.700
Mm-hmm.

18:21.060 --> 18:26.320
If it comes to it, I'll overwhelm you 
with praise until you beg me to stop.

18:26.320 --> 18:27.960
Ooh, scary!

18:28.500 --> 18:32.710
But seriously, I wouldn't be able to 
take it if you did that, so please don't.

18:33.510 --> 18:35.960
Then have a little more 
confidence in yourself.

18:39.530 --> 18:40.480
Thanks.

18:41.470 --> 18:41.910
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:41.470 --> 18:43.470
Platform 2      First Departure 18:31      Express

18:42.160 --> 18:42.960
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:43.180 --> 18:43.460
The train is arriving. Please be careful...

18:43.470 --> 18:45.970
<b>Karaoke</b>

18:43.470 --> 18:45.970
<b>Big Reco</b>

18:46.620 --> 18:50.230
Well then, I wouldn't mind 
hearing a little more about yesterday.

18:50.580 --> 18:53.780
It isn't the kind of relationship 
you think it is, Kadowaki.

18:53.780 --> 18:56.990
I get the feeling it isn't exactly 
how you're describing it, either.

18:57.280 --> 18:58.740
Oh, come on.

18:58.740 --> 19:03.160
Yeah, it's a little more than friendship 
between Amane and Shiina-san.

19:03.820 --> 19:07.370
Especially when he has her over 
to make dinner every day.

19:07.370 --> 19:08.250
Huh?

19:08.250 --> 19:09.330
Itsuki!

19:09.330 --> 19:11.470
Hey, he would've figured it out anyway.

19:11.470 --> 19:13.130
It's better to just get it out of the way.

19:15.580 --> 19:16.630
What now?

19:17.610 --> 19:18.630
Like a wife-in-training?

19:18.630 --> 19:24.260
N-No way! We live alone and it's easier to 
split the cost and share meals. That's it!

19:24.900 --> 19:26.370
There you have it.

19:26.370 --> 19:28.180
Not very convincing.

19:28.180 --> 19:30.140
You, too, Kadowaki?

19:30.510 --> 19:34.900
Usually, girls don't stay with guys 
they aren't interested in,

19:35.280 --> 19:38.650
and they won't go into a guy's room 
unless they're totally comfortable around him.

19:38.650 --> 19:39.860
This guy gets it!

19:40.190 --> 19:43.710
So be honest, Fujimiya. 
Don't you actually like Shiina-san?

19:43.710 --> 19:45.240
Would you give me a break?

19:50.900 --> 19:52.780
So what if I do like her?

19:57.240 --> 19:58.460
I'm home.

19:58.460 --> 20:00.030
W-Welcome home!

20:01.010 --> 20:02.510
How was karaoke?

20:03.130 --> 20:05.680
Kadowaki asked me all sorts of questions.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.510
That sounds exhausting.

20:08.340 --> 20:10.270
What did you just hide there?

20:10.270 --> 20:13.610
H-Hide? No, I...

20:14.220 --> 20:15.440
You won't get angry?

20:15.440 --> 20:17.770
Were you doing something 
that will make me angry?

20:18.840 --> 20:21.190
That may depend on the circumstances.

20:23.220 --> 20:25.200
Will you at least tell me what it is?

20:25.860 --> 20:29.820
Well, Shihoko-san sent me 
some old pictures of you...

20:29.820 --> 20:31.580
Is my mom some kind of <i>idiot</i>?!

20:32.190 --> 20:34.960
Th-There's an explanation for this!

20:35.300 --> 20:39.960
I was talking to Shihoko-san 
when the subject of Children's Day came up,

20:40.460 --> 20:44.430
and when I said, "I bet Amane-kun was 
really cute as a child,"

20:44.430 --> 20:46.060
things just happened...

20:46.060 --> 20:48.030
Wait. Let me check them.

20:48.510 --> 20:50.540
She better not have sent you anything nasty!

20:55.700 --> 20:57.260
My dear Mahiru-san,

20:57.260 --> 21:00.730
you can either hand over the pictures now, 
or be hounded by me forever.

21:00.730 --> 21:01.530
Which will it be?

21:30.060 --> 21:31.140
Huh?

21:32.360 --> 21:33.640
You look so weird!

21:35.800 --> 21:39.330
You push a girl down, 
put your hands on her face,

21:39.330 --> 21:41.200
and that's all you have to say for yourself?

21:41.630 --> 21:44.100
Yeah, I'm honestly sorry about that.

21:44.520 --> 21:48.080
I unlocked it. Look as much as you want.

21:48.080 --> 21:49.160
Thanks.

21:51.030 --> 21:54.300
<i>Another second and I might've 
acted like a real jerk.</i>

21:55.300 --> 21:59.280
You said you wanted to check them. 
Aren't you going to look?

21:59.280 --> 22:01.440
Sorry. I was thinking about something.

22:02.110 --> 22:02.800
Dummy.

22:10.310 --> 22:12.760
<i>Outer space is huge</i>

22:12.760 --> 22:15.110
<i>But only one of these planets</i>

22:15.110 --> 22:17.410
<i>Is our own blue planet, Earth</i>

22:17.410 --> 22:19.850
<i>And in that huge world</i>

22:19.850 --> 22:22.230
<i>A little message of love</i>

22:22.230 --> 22:24.570
<i>Is on its way to you</i>

22:24.570 --> 22:26.870
<i>Trying to make its way</i>

22:26.870 --> 22:29.760
<i>To you on that little island</i>

22:30.310 --> 22:32.710
<i>Ever since we first met</i>

22:32.710 --> 22:35.030
<i>There's a lot we've been through</i>

22:35.030 --> 22:37.480
<i>All these feelings I have</i>

22:37.480 --> 22:39.870
<i>Keep filling more letters, too</i>

22:39.870 --> 22:42.210
<i>Before you know it</i>

22:42.210 --> 22:44.500
<i>We’ll be singing together</i>

22:44.500 --> 22:46.820
<i>Sometimes powerful</i>

22:46.820 --> 22:49.140
<i>Sometimes heartbreaking</i>

22:49.140 --> 22:51.590
<i>When that song starts ringing out</i>

22:51.590 --> 22:53.970
<i>It will be heard far away</i>

22:53.970 --> 22:56.310
<i>And that sweet song</i>

22:56.310 --> 23:02.190
<i>Will change the world</i>

23:02.190 --> 23:05.990
<i>Listen, the one person</i>

23:05.990 --> 23:08.280
<i>Who’s dearest to you</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:11.610
<i>Is right next to you</i>

23:11.610 --> 23:15.350
<i>I just want to send this your way</i>

23:15.350 --> 23:17.700
<i>I'm hoping it will reach</i>

23:17.700 --> 23:21.040
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:25.550
<i>Listen</i>

23:25.550 --> 23:30.340
<i>Listen</i>

23:30.340 --> 23:35.390
<i>Listen</i>

23:35.390 --> 23:39.120
<i>Please hear my love song</i>
